\item[S2] Tomasz Schoen and Olof Sisask, Roth's theorem for four variables and additive structures in sums of sparse sets, arXiv:1408.2568; Forum Math. Sigma 4 (2016), e5. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1408.2568}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

